#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:5 22fb4f349ec74bc9a91901f8beb42393
msgid "ROS with SITL"
msgstr "ROS 与 SITL（软件在环仿真）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:8 8d8cb43d3ce04ce58469188be9a801d0
msgid "Connect ArduPilot to ROS"
msgstr "将 ArduPilot 连接到 ROS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:10 2065a1bf50cf48bca6080cb69e4e7cb8
msgid ""
"First, a good ROS habit is to always work in a workspace directory, so "
"create one: Open a terminal"
msgstr "首先，良好的 ROS 习惯是始终在工作空间目录中工作，因此先创建一个：打开终端"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:20 ad6f1a82b26240f98f58e091cad212c9
msgid ""
"OK ROS is ready to use, let's launch an SITL instance. Refer to "
":ref:`setting-up-sitl-on-linux` to know how to install SITL. Navigate to "
"your SITL install and launch a copter session:"
msgstr ""
"ROS 准备就绪，现在启动一个 SITL（软件在环仿真）实例。参见 :ref:`setting-up-sitl-on-linux` 了解如何安装 "
"SITL。进入您的 SITL 安装目录并启动一个 Copter 会话："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:28 b1e6bedb7615406c9a34d57e672a931a
msgid "(--console to show mavproxy console, --map to have the copter on map)"
msgstr "（--console 显示 mavproxy 控制台，--map 在地图上显示 Copter）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:30 c144d7a8ff844b8c9c35fd167d6115ba
msgid ""
"Now you got an SITL instance launched with TCP and UDP access, you should "
"have some line like:"
msgstr "现在 SITL 实例已启动，支持 TCP 和 UDP 访问，您应看到如下输出："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:36 3767ffea37aa464e80a7867638525bb9
msgid ""
"Both \"--out\" refer to UDP connexion create by MAVProxy. We will use UDP "
"access with mavros."
msgstr "两个「--out」均指 MAVProxy 创建的 UDP 连接，我们将使用 UDP 访问连接 mavros。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:38 0cc5d10cbc1a41f6affcca87a837e9ff
msgid ""
"Get back to your ROS terminal. Let's create a new directory for our launch "
"file."
msgstr "回到 ROS 终端，为 launch 文件创建一个新目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:47 6bb8e25f112b4e6096a4acc7936e2ec2
msgid "It is simpler to write launch file than remembering ROS command."
msgstr "编写 launch 文件比记忆 ROS 命令更简便。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:49 168fb65ef5164bfcb271bba263fa83cb
msgid "Let's copy MAVROS default launchfile for ArduPilot :"
msgstr "复制 MAVROS 为 ArduPilot 提供的默认 launch 文件："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:55 a947ef901ba548e6b5c492d89fd3e3d4
msgid ""
"You should have a new file in your directory called \"apm.launch\". "
"\"roscp\" command is just a helper to call system command on ROS package. "
"Open it with your favorite editor, mine is gedit."
msgstr ""
"您的目录中应出现名为「apm.launch」的新文件。「roscp」命令只是在 ROS 软件包上调用系统命令的辅助工具。用您喜欢的编辑器打开它，我用的是"
" gedit。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:87 5bad148639124c3ab7f87d5a9db98fc3
msgid ""
"To connect to SITL we just need to modify the first line to ``<arg "
"name=\"fcu_url\" default=\"udp://127.0.0.1:14551@14555\" />``. save you file"
" and launch it with"
msgstr ""
"连接 SITL（软件在环仿真）只需将第一行修改为 ``<arg name=\"fcu_url\" "
"default=\"udp://127.0.0.1:14551@14555\" />``。保存文件并用以下命令启动"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:93 8be34bb815dd4b5d9cdb9268d4d7117e
msgid ""
"You should see some verbose from MAVROS that read its configuration and some"
" line that indicate a connexion:"
msgstr "您应能看到 MAVROS 读取配置的详细输出，以及若干表示已连接的行："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:113 794eb44fc0f046948f70214a18a67c8b
msgid "The connection was done !l!"
msgstr "连接已建立！"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:115 1a2847db7b074ecab5031b39b31dacba
msgid ""
"Let use RQT to how ArduPilot information are shown in ROS. Normally, MAVROS "
"will do most of the translation MAVLink <--> ROS open another terminal and "
"launch RQT with"
msgstr ""
"使用 RQT 查看 ArduPilot 信息在 ROS 中的显示方式。通常 MAVROS 会完成大部分 MAVLink <-> ROS "
"的转换，打开另一个终端并使用以下命令启动 RQT"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:122 0d41d33ee78b427ca8c8729122d6a200
msgid ""
"go to plugins/ topics /topics monitor TADAM! !!!! You see all the topics "
"that mavros has to create from ArduPilot information, click on the box to "
"see the current value. You could see in plugins/robot tools/ runtime monitor"
" that everything is ok!"
msgstr ""
"进入 plugins/topics/topics monitor，大功告成！您可看到 mavros 从 ArduPilot "
"信息创建的所有话题，点击方框查看当前值。在 plugins/robot tools/runtime monitor 中可确认一切正常！"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:126 e99a383e5f9b485a8dde5fbe3cf10491
msgid ""
"Let's try to change mode with mavros: go to plugins / services/ services "
"caller set service to /mavros/set_mode set custom_mode to 'GUIDED' and click"
" the call button The response should be true, you can look on /mavros/state "
"topic that the mode is now GUIDED. it should be the same in you MAVProxy "
"console."
msgstr ""
"尝试用 mavros 切换模式：进入 plugins/services/services caller，将 service 设为 "
"/mavros/set_mode，将 custom_mode 设为「GUIDED」，点击 call 按钮。响应应为 true，可在 "
"/mavros/state 话题中确认模式现在为 GUIDED，MAVProxy 控制台中应同步显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:132 4c7c4ed8fd1b4877b1bb15fe705cf948
msgid ""
"Now, you know the base of ROS usage with ArduPilot! ROS got plenty others "
"features that you can use like plotting, 3d visualisation, etc."
msgstr "现在您已掌握 ROS 与 ArduPilot 配合使用的基础！ROS 还有许多其他功能可供使用，如绘图、3D 可视化等。"
